        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli naagira ati: Nyanga okushenda, n'omuntu orikweshwekyerera, aine obubisha aha mukazi we; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. N'ahabw'ekyo mwerinde, murekye kuba endeebya.",
